    "Testing-only workflow for the sweep harness; hidden from the template browser. Based on dgx-monarch-moss-image-t2i, with only the changes needed for this test. 1040x1040 is a 65 by 65 grid, 4225 image rows, an odd image block. The stream is the image rows followed by the prompt's rows, so whether uly2 pads depends on the total: an even prompt length makes it odd and pads one row at the tail, an odd one does not."
